WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:02.961
You can also do the mirror exercise with a friend or by

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.447
reading your own notes aloud.

00:00:04.957 --> 00:00:07.605
Ask the listener to describe the desired experience

00:00:07.639 --> 00:00:09.125
without naming a technology.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:12.910
If they cannot tell whether the owner manually replies or

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.871
the software sends messages, add that distinction.

00:00:16.312 --> 00:00:19.169
If they ask how long records remain available and you do

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.769
not know, mark it as an open decision.

00:00:22.152 --> 00:00:25.124
The purpose is shared understanding, not proving how much

00:00:25.206 --> 00:00:26.982
technical terminology you know.

00:00:27.585 --> 00:00:29.513
You can move forward when the central journey and

00:00:29.559 --> 00:00:32.612
decision-changing boundaries are clear, and continue to

00:00:32.659 --> 00:00:35.387
resolve smaller questions at the appropriate stage.
